{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/47qt0zax","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":88.56,"top":193.68,"width":792.02,"height":61.6},"name":"Google Shape;241;p33","text":"Trigger: a July 2 rule update targeted malicious JavaScript. “Simulate” mode still executed the regex on real traffic.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F7F9FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/j6hs7utc","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":64.8,"top":276.48,"width":7.92,"height":7.92},"name":"Google Shape;242;p33","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#189D94","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#000000","alignment":"center"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/i58bypsr","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":88.56,"top":267.12,"width":792.02,"height":61.6},"name":"Google Shape;243;p33","text":"Impact: 27 minutes of disruption. Visitors saw 502 errors, CPU reached 100%, and traffic fell 82% at its worst.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F7F9FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/h4za5kb6","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":64.8,"top":349.92,"width":7.92,"height":7.92},"name":"Google Shape;244;p33","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#189D94","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#000000","alignment":"center"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wjqtwfa1","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":88.56,"top":340.56,"width":792.02,"height":61.6},"name":"Google Shape;245;p33","text":"Operational impact: customers also lost Dashboard/API access, while engineers struggled to reach internal recovery tools.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F7F9FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vihs3atg","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":57,"top":457,"width":835,"height":27},"text":"Sources: Cloudflare incident update (July 2) and postmortem (July 12, 2019)","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":11.51,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#9DACBC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/udsvah03","slideIndex":0,"text":"Sources: https://blog.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-outage/\nhttps://blog.cloudflare.com/details-of-the-cloudflare-outage-on-july-2-2019/\nThe 82% figure is Cloudflare’s worst reported traffic drop, not the percentage of the Internet affected. Customer-facing implications include failed page loads and interrupted online transactions. The cited reports do not quantify total financial losses."}
