{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2143alwj","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":88.56,"top":120.24,"width":792.02,"height":61.6},"name":"Google Shape;254;p34","text":"Expensive matching: overlapping wildcards in .*.*=.* made the engine repeatedly retry matches, exhausting CPU.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F7F9FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/n2dk36d4","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":64.8,"top":203.04,"width":7.92,"height":7.92},"name":"Google Shape;255;p34","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#189D94","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#000000","alignment":"center"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/o3mlcbep","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":88.56,"top":193.68,"width":792.02,"height":61.6},"name":"Google Shape;256;p34","text":"Refactoring regression: an earlier performance refactor accidentally removed a CPU safeguard.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F7F9FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/pov25gva","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":64.8,"top":276.48,"width":7.92,"height":7.92},"name":"Google Shape;257;p34","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#189D94","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#000000","alignment":"center"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/exk361wn","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":88.56,"top":267.12,"width":792.02,"height":61.6},"name":"Google Shape;258;p34","text":"Testing gap: functional tests passed, but the suite did not detect excessive CPU consumption.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F7F9FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/fytkz6d8","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":64.8,"top":349.92,"width":7.92,"height":7.92},"name":"Google Shape;259;p34","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#189D94","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#000000","alignment":"center"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/j29072t0","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":88.56,"top":340.56,"width":792.02,"height":61.6},"name":"Google Shape;260;p34","text":"Deployment risk: rules bypassed staged rollout and reached the global network within seconds.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F7F9FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/i1gzexcf","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":57,"top":457,"width":835,"height":27},"text":"Source: Cloudflare engineering postmortem, July 12, 2019","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":11.51,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#9DACBC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/m90b6t0r","slideIndex":1,"text":"Source: https://blog.cloudflare.com/details-of-the-cloudflare-outage-on-july-2-2019/\nThe regex shown is a simplified fragment, not the full production rule.\nAnalysis: performance limits are part of a system’s operational contract. Refactoring requires regression checks for resource consumption as well as matching correctness."}
