{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ov6t8r6l","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":57,"top":457,"width":835,"height":27},"text":"Source: Cloudflare postmortem, July 12, 2019. Lessons are case analysis.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":11.51,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#9DACBC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/8f2psfyx","slideIndex":3,"text":"Source for completed and announced actions: https://blog.cloudflare.com/details-of-the-cloudflare-outage-on-july-2-2019/\nThe final two bullets are case analysis. Corrective maintenance restores service. Preventive maintenance reduces recurrence risk. The postmortem lists planned engineering work, not measured long-term reliability gains.\nDiscussion: What performance invariant should a refactoring test preserve?"}